utton><button class="pk-opt" data-mode="live" disabled title="Refuted/exploratory — must survive a week in shadow first">Live</button><button class="pk-opt" data-mode="skip">Skip</button></div><div class="pk-note">Live locked — prove it in shadow first.</div></div>
